title: Fundraising
new-page: true
view-if: fundraising_timer <= 0 and (not historical_mode)
on-arrival: fundraising_timer = 6; month_actions += 1
frequency: 300
is-card: true
card-image: img/poster_2.jpg
tags: party_affairs

= Fundraising

For better or for worse, the organization cannot exist without money. Unlike the establishment wing, we rely mostly on small-dollar donors and membership dues rather than large donors.

- @maintain: Maintain our current dues structure.
- @reduce: Reduce dues.
- @increase: Increase dues.

@maintain
subtitle: [+ dues +] resources gained.
on-arrival: resources += dues;

We maintain our current dues structure.

@reduce
subtitle: [+ dues - 1 +] resources gained.
choose-if: dues > 1
on-arrival: dues -= 1; resources += dues; insurgent_dissent -= 8; progressive_dissent -= 8; labor_left_dissent -= 8; blue_dog_dissent -= 8

Our current members appreciate this, but no one joins because dues are low.

@increase
subtitle: [+ dues + 1 +] resources gained. [? if unemployed >= 8 : Given the present economic situation, this may be painful. ?][? if dues >= 4 : Dues are already rather high; increasing them might reduce membership. ?]
on-arrival: dues += 1; resources += dues; working_class_dem -= 3; working_class_dem -= 10 if unemployed >= 8; working_class_dem -= 3*dues if dues >= 5;
view-if: dues <= 4

Our members grumble at this, and some of the less committed ones lapse. But now, we have access to additional resources.

[? if unemployed >= 8 : Because of the presently elevated unemployment rate, our members are feeling the extra burden hard. ?]
